16:10.708 --> 16:14.016
All right, all right. It's...

16:14.060 --> 16:15.191
It's in the vase. The vase.

16:17.498 --> 16:19.152
Shanice, retrieve the package.

16:25.027 --> 16:27.856
No, the other vase.

16:27.899 --> 16:29.858
- Just grab it, please.
- Okay, bet.

16:32.600 --> 16:33.644
Vas-y, vas-y. Come on.

16:40.042 --> 16:42.305
Emilio...

16:42.392 --> 16:44.003
don't come to dinner tonight.

16:45.874 --> 16:48.659
Carlos, I am so sorry.

16:48.746 --> 16:51.010
Shall we, ladies?

16:51.053 --> 16:52.663
It's drugs, isn't it?

17:33.008 --> 17:34.575
We were beginning to worry.

17:34.662 --> 17:36.490
Well, I had some surprise
friends from out of town come.

17:38.927 --> 17:40.798
We have extra seats.
Please stay for dinner.

17:40.885 --> 17:43.453
- Oh, no, no, no.
We won't be staying.
- What? Why not?

17:43.497 --> 17:46.369
Uh, give me a second.

17:46.413 --> 17:49.503
Um, because we weren't invited,
Xosha.

17:49.546 --> 17:52.027
She just invited us.

17:52.027 --> 17:54.073
Okay, and we had
a really long day

17:54.116 --> 17:56.249
that we need to recover from.

17:56.336 --> 17:57.815
Okay, well,
we was just talking about--

17:57.902 --> 17:59.600
this morning,
you was complaining about,

17:59.687 --> 18:01.906
"There's nothing
really fun to do,"

18:01.906 --> 18:03.952
- and...
- Yeah. You were saying how
to find the cool stuff

18:03.995 --> 18:05.823
we have to know a local.
Boom, there go some locals.

18:05.823 --> 18:07.564
Something is wrong, all right?

18:07.608 --> 18:09.088
I know this is all fun and games
to y'all,

18:09.131 --> 18:10.741
but there is something seriously
wrong with Van right now.

18:10.785 --> 18:12.830
Girl, let her live her life.

18:12.830 --> 18:14.658
Yeah, I mean,
she ain't hurting nobody.

18:16.704 --> 18:18.401
I mean, okay,
she's hurting people,

18:18.445 --> 18:21.143
but they're seemingly people
who deserve to be hurt.

18:21.187 --> 18:24.233
She has blood on a baguette
that she's carrying around.

18:25.756 --> 18:27.758
You're only saying that
because you don't know her.

18:27.802 --> 18:31.240
Yeah, we don't,
but I like whoever this is.

18:31.284 --> 18:33.721
- I'm-a go grab a drink.
- Yeah. Me, too. Sorry, girl.

18:40.815 --> 18:42.164
Hey, excuse me.

18:42.208 --> 18:43.687
- Can I talk to you?
- Oh.

18:44.775 --> 18:46.212
Bravo.

18:51.217 --> 18:53.088
You really fucked me back there.

18:55.090 --> 18:58.659
Paparazzi got ahold
of the story.

18:58.746 --> 19:00.443
I might lose
the Baby Shark movie now.

19:05.013 --> 19:08.930
Don't you ever do that again.

19:14.022 --> 19:15.110
Let's go meet Marcel.

19:25.816 --> 19:28.558
Think you can just
humiliate me like that?

19:28.602 --> 19:30.038
Huh?

19:37.654 --> 19:40.048
- Hey, Van.
- Ça va, chéri?

19:40.135 --> 19:41.963
- Et toi?
- Oh, Marcel.

19:42.006 --> 19:44.183
Mm.

19:54.671 --> 19:56.238
I missed you.

19:56.282 --> 19:57.935
Ah, where the fuck were you,
huh?

19:58.022 --> 20:00.808
Emilio, he really fucked us
this time.

20:00.851 --> 20:02.810
- I'm not doing it again.

20:02.853 --> 20:05.726
Oh, before I forget,
this is my friend, Candice.

20:05.726 --> 20:08.119
We both met while we were
stripping on that river cruise.

20:08.163 --> 20:08.946
- Oh, of course.

20:12.211 --> 20:13.560
We need to talk. Right now.

20:17.738 --> 20:19.087
Uh, you want to talk?

20:19.174 --> 20:21.655
Yeah. What the fuck is going on?

20:21.655 --> 20:23.744
Merci.

20:23.831 --> 20:25.746
What, you don't
approve of my lifestyle?

20:25.833 --> 20:29.315
No. No. You're done...

20:29.358 --> 20:31.578
You're done making me feel
like I'm crazy.

20:31.621 --> 20:34.015
Okay, 'cause today was
nowhere near normal, Van.

20:34.058 --> 20:35.886
Oh, mon Dieu.

20:41.675 --> 20:44.199
Does Earn know you're here?

20:44.199 --> 20:46.680
Does anyone know
that you're here?

20:46.723 --> 20:48.421
Does your parents know
that you're here, Van?

20:48.421 --> 20:51.293
Because don't think I didn't
clock your phone blowing up.

20:51.337 --> 20:54.209
What? A very busy woman cannot
receive many phone calls?

20:54.209 --> 20:55.906
God, can you just please
talk normal?

20:55.950 --> 20:58.126
- I am talking normal.
- Without the fake accent, Van.

20:58.213 --> 21:02.173
What are you doing?

21:02.217 --> 21:04.088
Really, like,
what-what are you doing here?

21:06.003 --> 21:08.092
What are you doing here?

21:08.136 --> 21:10.007
Peeing on some guy?

21:10.007 --> 21:13.141
No, it's-it's very interesting.

21:13.228 --> 21:15.578
You know, I know you, Candice.

21:15.622 --> 21:17.145
I know you like to be
the fancy one.

21:17.188 --> 21:19.147
I know, uh...

21:19.190 --> 21:22.324
God forbid anybody tries to be
more interesting than you.

21:22.368 --> 21:23.804
Or anybody tries to do anything

21:23.804 --> 21:25.414
that is, uh,
not worth your approval.

21:28.896 --> 21:30.680
And the only reason you're angry
with me right now is

21:30.724 --> 21:32.769
because you're not
in control of me.

21:32.813 --> 21:33.292
Is that not true?

21:36.251 --> 21:37.818
Because you're so in control,
right?

21:37.818 --> 21:39.602
You're so in control, you almost
beat a man to death

21:39.689 --> 21:41.343
- with a fucking baguette, Van.
- Van? Again?

21:41.387 --> 21:43.737
Enough, please.

21:43.780 --> 21:45.129
Marcel, are these ready?

21:45.173 --> 21:46.174
- Yeah.
- Thank you.

21:47.828 --> 21:48.742
Are those hands?

21:54.182 --> 21:56.140
We've been chasing hands
all day?

21:56.184 --> 21:58.055
Yeah.

21:58.055 --> 22:00.580
I will keep my remarks brief

22:00.623 --> 22:02.321
and in English
for those of our foreign guests.

22:05.106 --> 22:06.586
Thank you all for coming.

22:06.629 --> 22:09.197
Tonight's meal,
prepared by Marcel,

22:09.197 --> 22:11.895
is truly a sacred experience.

22:14.463 --> 22:16.639
If you are here, it is
because I know you appreciate

22:16.726 --> 22:18.946
and revere life's
most beautiful experiences.

22:20.339 --> 22:21.340
You will not be disappointed.

22:23.820 --> 22:25.126
You all have in front of you
a napkin.

22:26.954 --> 22:28.999
While some of you
may be familiar,

22:28.999 --> 22:31.524
I offer a reminder.

22:31.524 --> 22:35.658
We will eat this meal with this
napkin draped over our heads,

22:35.702 --> 22:37.356
as is traditional
with Les Mains.

22:39.793 --> 22:42.143
This is not out of shame,
as some may speculate.

22:45.842 --> 22:47.540
Quite the opposite.

22:47.540 --> 22:51.065
It is to allow a private and
sensuous moment with a meal.

22:51.108 --> 22:53.981
A meal that I assure you

22:54.024 --> 22:57.854
rivals even the finest banquet
at Mount Olympus.

22:57.898 --> 22:58.768
And now,

22:58.812 --> 23:00.988
Les Main.

23:01.031 --> 23:02.119
Bon appétit.

23:06.863 --> 23:08.822
Let's go.

23:10.389 --> 23:12.347
First class.

23:12.434 --> 23:13.696
Girl, this is
some high-end shit.

23:15.481 --> 23:16.786
I feel like I'm in
Beauty and the Beast.

23:16.830 --> 23:19.136
Mad exclusive.

23:19.223 --> 23:20.921
Mm, smells amazing.

23:21.008 --> 23:22.705
Kind of earthy.

23:26.840 --> 23:29.930
- Hey, look.

23:29.930 --> 23:32.672
If you want to live your life...

23:32.715 --> 23:34.369
doing this crazy sh--
Shit, sorry.

23:34.413 --> 23:37.067
Um... Okay.

23:38.808 --> 23:41.115
But what about your old life?

23:41.158 --> 23:42.943
Change is good, Candice.

23:44.510 --> 23:46.294
Yeah. But, I mean,
what happens

23:46.294 --> 23:49.558
when your visa runs out?

23:49.602 --> 23:51.038
Marcel and I,
we will get married.

23:51.081 --> 23:52.213
It's easy.

23:55.521 --> 23:57.348
Okay.

23:57.392 --> 23:59.176
Have you talked
to your parents?

23:59.176 --> 24:01.178
They're going to be thrilled
for me.

24:01.265 --> 24:02.702
They've always wanted me
to get married.

24:02.745 --> 24:04.094
They've always wanted
to visit Paris.

24:04.094 --> 24:06.096
Hmm.

24:06.096 --> 24:07.576
And money?

24:09.360 --> 24:11.667
I am working, as you can see.

24:14.104 --> 24:16.759
And Lottie?

24:16.846 --> 24:19.196
Where does she fit
into all this?

24:24.071 --> 24:27.074
I'm going to, uh...

24:27.117 --> 24:29.772
I'm going to, uh...

24:29.859 --> 24:31.992
bring her here.

24:31.992 --> 24:33.254
With me.

24:34.124 --> 24:36.953
Uh...

24:36.997 --> 24:38.302
to eat hands?

25:03.458 --> 25:05.373
Get out.

25:05.416 --> 25:06.635
- Get out!
- No, no, no, no, no.

25:06.679 --> 25:08.811
- Get out!
- No, no, no, no. No, no, no, no.

25:08.855 --> 25:10.596
- No, no! Please, Van!

25:10.639 --> 25:12.249
- Get the fuck out of here!
- What the fuck
are you doing?

25:12.249 --> 25:13.555
- Van?
- Get out!

25:13.599 --> 25:15.470
Van, stop! Arrête!

25:15.557 --> 25:17.037
- Arrête!

25:22.390 --> 25:25.393
What the fuck am I doing here?!

25:25.393 --> 25:27.177
- What?!

25:43.237 --> 25:45.456
Uh-uh-uh. You hear that?

25:45.500 --> 25:47.067
Yeah, what is that?

25:50.723 --> 25:53.508
Oh, my God, girl.
This is... this is a hand!

25:53.508 --> 25:55.466
- Bitch, this is a whole hand.
- Oh, my God.

25:55.510 --> 25:57.207
- Oh, my God.

25:57.294 --> 25:59.470
Y'all are eating hands!

25:59.514 --> 26:01.168
Y'all, this is a hand. Hello?

26:01.211 --> 26:03.387
- That's fucking gross.
- Oh, my God.

26:03.431 --> 26:04.519
We need to get the fuck
up out of here!

26:04.606 --> 26:05.520
- Where's Candice?
- These people are crazy.

26:05.564 --> 26:07.217
Come on. Come on, come on,
come on.

26:07.261 --> 26:08.436
Eating hands, shit!

26:09.959 --> 26:11.091
All right!

26:11.134 --> 26:13.310
I'm starving!

26:13.397 --> 26:14.573
Where are these little hands?

26:19.316 --> 26:20.579
I want to see Lottie.

26:20.622 --> 26:23.059
Where's Lottie?
Where's Lottie?

26:23.103 --> 26:24.452
- Where's Lottie?
- Van.

26:24.495 --> 26:26.236
- Where's Lottie?
- Hey, okay.

26:26.280 --> 26:28.064
All right, we can find her.

26:28.108 --> 26:29.588
- I know.

26:37.204 --> 26:40.207
I've just been feeling
really off for a while.

26:47.867 --> 26:50.043
I don't really know
for how long, but...

26:52.959 --> 26:56.223
Couple weeks ago,
I was driving in Atlanta and...

26:56.266 --> 26:59.487
this dark feeling came over me.

27:02.142 --> 27:03.926
I, uh...

27:04.013 --> 27:06.973
I...

27:09.062 --> 27:11.499
I closed my eyes.

27:15.372 --> 27:18.158
I closed my eyes
while I was driving.

27:23.903 --> 27:27.689
And then I got... got scared,
so I opened my eyes,

27:27.733 --> 27:29.996
and I was in the opposite lane.

27:31.650 --> 27:34.914
And...

27:34.957 --> 27:37.307
once I realized
what I was doing...

27:41.572 --> 27:44.227
I just cri-cried
all the way home.

27:47.100 --> 27:49.102
And I just, I thought about...

27:50.712 --> 27:52.888
How I'm a... I'm a terrible mom.

27:56.762 --> 27:59.112
And when I picked Lottie up
from school,

27:59.155 --> 28:01.767
I just f-- I felt like
she was looking at me,

28:01.810 --> 28:04.552
like... like she knew
what happened.

28:06.380 --> 28:08.904
And that she hated me for it.

28:11.646 --> 28:14.083
That I would do that to her.

28:15.650 --> 28:17.739
So I...
I brought her to my mom's,

28:17.783 --> 28:19.698
and I bought a ticket to Europe.

28:22.178 --> 28:24.659
I don't even remember
that flight.

28:24.659 --> 28:27.314
I just, I was just...
blacked out.

28:27.357 --> 28:29.055
And I land in Amsterdam.

28:31.231 --> 28:32.885
Like, what the fuck am I doing
in Amsterdam?

28:39.239 --> 28:41.720
And I couldn't sleep.

28:41.763 --> 28:45.680
You know, this jet lag and...

28:45.767 --> 28:48.465
I was watching TV all night,
and I...

28:49.597 --> 28:52.382
And then...

28:52.469 --> 28:54.341
Amélie came on.

28:54.384 --> 28:56.822
And then I was like,
I want to be,

28:56.865 --> 29:00.564
I want to be Amélie,
and I came here.

29:00.608 --> 29:03.393
And I couldn't... I couldn't...

29:03.437 --> 29:05.178
Couldn't do that, either.

29:08.703 --> 29:10.749
Well...

29:12.707 --> 29:15.057
That's because you're cooler
than Amélie.

29:15.101 --> 29:17.407
I'm not cooler than Amélie.

29:17.451 --> 29:19.148
Yes, you are.

29:22.673 --> 29:24.327
I don't even know who I am.

29:29.289 --> 29:32.683
You know who you are.

29:32.727 --> 29:34.816
Earn knows who he is.

29:34.860 --> 29:38.298
Lottie knows who she is.

29:38.298 --> 29:40.343
But who the fuck am I?
I don't even know.

29:42.432 --> 29:44.478
You're somebody.

29:44.521 --> 29:46.785
I-I don't know. That's...

29:50.614 --> 29:52.486
Oh, my God.

29:52.529 --> 29:54.140
You're gonna be okay.

29:56.751 --> 29:58.100
Okay.

30:02.713 --> 30:04.803
Don't you have to pee
on someone?

30:09.372 --> 30:10.634
Yes, I do.

30:11.679 --> 30:12.985
He'll be fine.

30:15.814 --> 30:17.685
I need to go home.

30:21.863 --> 30:23.996
Let's go home.

30:37.357 --> 30:38.793
Hello?

30:38.837 --> 30:40.403
Uh, hi.

30:46.801 --> 30:48.672
Nice.

30:48.716 --> 30:49.848
You can put your things
by the door.

30:53.808 --> 30:55.462
May I offer you some champagne?

30:55.505 --> 30:57.899
Cheese or grapes?

30:57.943 --> 30:59.509
No, I had, like, two bottles of
Powerade for lunch.

30:59.596 --> 31:01.294
Let's just do this.

31:01.381 --> 31:02.991
Yeah. Of course.

32:14.933 --> 32:16.586
Stop.

33:42.890 --> 33:44.500
- Hey.
- Earnest Marks?

33:44.544 --> 33:46.981
- Yeah.
- Sign here.

33:47.025 --> 33:49.679
- What's this?
- It's your bag.

33:49.723 --> 33:51.333
I got all my bags.

33:51.420 --> 33:53.074
- Your name Earnest Marks?
- Yeah.

33:53.118 --> 33:54.815
- You travel on May 8?
- Yeah.

33:54.858 --> 33:56.034
It's your bag. Sign here.

34:04.433 --> 34:05.695
I know this is not my bag.

34:05.739 --> 34:08.002
Cool. Have a nice day, bro.

35:04.667 --> 35:06.408
Hmm.
